  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"archive-header\">\n\n\t<h1 class=\"archive-title\">Cape Cod</h1>\n\n\t\n\t\n</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-4416 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-art-in-the-park category-events category-news tag-art-in-the-park tag-cape-cod tag-harwich-port\" id=\"post-4416\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/new-season-of-art-in-the-park/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"667\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A woman in a pink shirt holding a painting easel.\" src=\"/media/archive/9902e5ae0c0e83b7e7f07d85ba9344d2d26558e0f23e546f35fd637bddd6b8aa.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/new-season-of-art-in-the-park/\" rel=\"bookmark\">New Season of Art in the Park</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2019-06-27T08:26:47-04:00\" title=\"Thursday, June 27, 2019, 8:26 am\">June 27, 2019</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Art in The Park season kicks off Monday, July 1, 2019. Members of The Guild of Harwich Artists exhibit and sell original artwork in Harwich Port’s Doane Park in what has <a href=\"/news/new-season-of-art-in-the-park/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3947 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-news tag-cape-cod tag-cape-cod-art-galleries tag-cape-cod-artist tag-harwich-ma tag-harwich-port tag-meet-the-artist tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3947\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/meet-the-artist-august-4/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"640\" height=\"392\" alt=\"A picture of a teepee in a frame.\" src=\"/media/archive/e2325b07094631c7cfe0ba8a3e2febc6f3657fa559d9a197eb0c5621d263b66f.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/meet-the-artist-august-4/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Meet The Artist August 4</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-07-31T21:17:51-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, July 31, 2018, 9:17 pm\">July 31, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Would you like to talk art with a master artist? Join Paul Hammersten who will spend the day, Saturday, August 4 discussing such questions as: What is art? Can creating <a href=\"/news/meet-the-artist-august-4/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3941 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-news tag-cape-cod tag-cape-cod-art-galleries tag-harwich-ma tag-harwich-port tag-meet-the-artist tag-passport-to-the-arts tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3941\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/busy-saturday-in-harwich-port/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"375\" height=\"500\" alt=\"Three women standing in front of a table with paints on it.\" src=\"/media/archive/bc8c17abbef9ade1c4bb8883a302263adaca3acf408992e7dd60fc16fd579e70.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/busy-saturday-in-harwich-port/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Busy Saturday in Harwich Port</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-07-23T14:37:13-04:00\" title=\"Monday, July 23, 2018, 2:37 pm\">July 23, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Art Gallery of The Guild of Harwich Artists hosted “Meet The Artist” with Marion Harcourt on Saturday, July 21. The Art Gallery also held the afternoon reception for the <a href=\"/news/busy-saturday-in-harwich-port/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3819 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-news tag-cape-cod tag-cape-cod-artist tag-harwich-community-center tag-harwich-ma tag-harwich-port tag-monthly-meetings tag-paint-the-town tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-the-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-the-warm-side-of-the-cape\" id=\"post-3819\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/guild-sponsors-free-art-events-june-16/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Guild Sponsors Free Art Events June 16</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-06-11T13:59:12-04:00\" title=\"Monday, June 11, 2018, 1:59 pm\">June 11, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Dear Artists and Art Lovers: YOU’RE INVITED! The Guild of Harwich Artists invites you to a “Make and Take” event When? Saturday, June 16, 2018, 1:30p.m. to 4:00p.m. Where? Harwich <a href=\"/news/guild-sponsors-free-art-events-june-16/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3817 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-meet-the-artist category-the-gallery category-gallery-artists category-news tag-cape-cod tag-cape-cod-art-galleries tag-cape-cod-artist tag-harwich-ma tag-harwich-port tag-meet-the-artist tag-paul-hammersten tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3817\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/june-09-meet-the-artist/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"395\" height=\"296\" alt=\"When the spirit tells my story of the cygnine.\" src=\"/media/archive/4eb263ed6631e879a24a2a32898c58ff4bf1160fd0a7b98325ca13fa3a6db570.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/june-09-meet-the-artist/\" rel=\"bookmark\">June 9 Meet The Artist</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-06-04T23:58:40-04:00\" title=\"Monday, June 4, 2018, 11:58 pm\">June 4, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Master Artist Paul Hammersten will be at The Art Gallery of the Guild of Harwich Artists on Saturday, June 9 from 10 AM to 4 PM to share the story <a href=\"/news/june-09-meet-the-artist/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3533 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-education category-events category-ornament-fundraiser category-the-gallery category-gallery-artists category-news tag-annual-ornament-fundraiser tag-cape-cod tag-christmas-in-harwich tag-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-harwich-childrens-fund tag-harwich-ma tag-the-childrens-center tag-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3533\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/local-organizations-benefit-from-annual-fundraiser/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"402\" height=\"500\" alt=\"Three woman and a cheque\" src=\"/media/archive/5aaa89ed4b76470d775ac1096a3ba906daf2de3810417c82b495b1ab8f8d7014.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/local-organizations-benefit-from-annual-fundraiser/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Local Organizations Benefit from Annual Fundraiser</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-01-29T20:50:39-05:00\" title=\"Monday, January 29, 2018, 8:50 pm\">January 29, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Guild of Harwich Artists’ Annual Ornament Fundraiser held during the Harwich Christmas Stroll and on the following weekends at the Art Gallery, was a huge success. Total proceeds after <a href=\"/news/local-organizations-benefit-from-annual-fundraiser/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t<nav class=\"navigation pagination\" aria-label=\"Posts pagination\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"screen-reader-text\">Posts pagination</h2>\n\t\t<div class=\"nav-links\"><span class=\"page-numbers current\">1</span>\n<a class=\"page-numbers\" title=\"Archived control; this function is not available here\" href>2</a><span data-fidelity